  "title": "FORMFACTOR, INC. ADDED TO MEMBERSHIP OF US LARGE-CAP RUSSELL US 1000® INDEX",
  "summary": "LIVERMORE, Calif. — June 24, 2026 – FormFactor, Inc. (Nasdaq: FORM) announced today that it was added as a member of the US large-cap Russell 1000® Index, effective when the US market opens on June 29th, as part of the 2026 Russell indexes reconstitution. Membership in the Russell 1000® Index, which remains in place for… Continue reading FORMFACTOR, INC. ADDED TO MEMBERSHIP OF US LARGE-CAP RUSSELL US 1000® INDEX",
